      "id": "s07-backoff-cap",
      "type": "single",
      "question": "重试退避的等待时间上限是多少秒？",
      "retrieved": [
        "04-scheduler-design.md",
        "08-faq.md",
        "08-faq.md",
        "05-retry-policy.md",
